"""PRODUCT_AUTOGENERATED synthetic dictation families.

Seed plan (split assigned before generation) -> Claude batch generation of
families (intended target first, then the noisy ASR-style transcript) ->
normalization re-anchoring -> deterministic gates -> engine capture
(``capture.py``) -> Claude batch verification -> dedup and split files.
Every record is machine-generated and labelled ``human_reviewed: false``.
"""

